OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would scrap
OL,4,Ainheritance tax on family homes and
OL,5,Aallow couples to leave extra #1m
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Conservative government would scrap
OL,8,Finheritance tax on family homes, leader
OL,9,FKemi Badenoch announces at the party
OL,10,Fconference in Birmingham
OL,12,FThere would also be a further #1m
OL,13,Ftax-free inheritance tax allowance for
OL,14,Fcouples - or #500,000 for individuals
OL,16,FThe move would cost #6bn by 2029/30,
OL,17,Fthe party says - paid for by spending
OL,18,Fcuts, including to welfare
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
