OL,3,AChrista Pike's lawyers to appear in
OL,4,Acourt after failed execution of US
OL,5,Adeath row inmate
OL,6,
OL,7,FPike's lawyers say she is now
OL,8,F"conscious and speaking" after
OL,9,Fsurviving two lethal doses of the drug
OL,10,Fpentobarbital - her lawyer says she
OL,11,Fcontinues to receive care while
OL,12,Fhandcuffed in hospital
OL,14,FPike was sentenced to death following
OL,15,Fher conviction for murdering Colleen
OL,16,FSlemmer in 1995
OL,18,FLater: Her legal team are set to give a
OL,19,Fnews conference following today's court
OL,20,Fhearing
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
