OL,3,A'What happened here was not human':
OL,4,AIsrael marks three years since 7
OL,5,AOctober attacks
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the site of the Nova music festival,
OL,8,Fwhere 378 people were killed and 44
OL,9,Ftaken hostage, the mother of one victim
OL,10,Fsays the attacks were "dystopic,
OL,11,Funimaginable"
OL,13,F"What happened here was not human,"
OL,14,Fsays Ahuva Yavin Mayze, whose daughter
OL,15,Fwas shot dead at the festival
OL,17,FIn response to the 7 October attacks,
OL,18,FIsrael launched a military offensive in
OL,19,FGaza in which more than 74,200 people
OL,20,Fhave been killed, according to the
OL,21,FHamas-run health ministry
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
